cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies (below).
title: biaseval
abstract: >-
  Code and released results for evaluating stereotypical bias across matched
  base and instruction-tuned language models. Includes CrowS-Pairs, StereoSet,
  BBQ, and IAT scoring; adversarial prompt framings; residual-stream probing;
  and INLP/LEACE concept-erasure interventions.
